# Server-side pipelines

A formal multi-model pipeline product is **out of the current control-plane/data-plane split**. If it is built later:

- It must be a **separate orchestrator** that is a **client of the gateway** (`POST /v1/models/{id}/infer`).
- Do **not** put workflow/orchestration back on the supervisor (`/api/v1/pipelines`) or inside the gateway process.
- The supervisor stays process lifecycle / catalog / logs / keys / UI only.
- The gateway stays a stateless reverse proxy.

Until that product exists, clients compose steps themselves by calling the gateway sequentially.
